    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以高举这张卡片，召唤一颗熊熊燃烧的陨石落到距你120尺内的可见地点。以那个点为中心，半径20尺范围内的每个生物都必须进行一次DC 17的敏捷豁免。豁免失败的生物会受到6d6点钝击伤害和6d6点火焰伤害，豁免成功只受一半伤害。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can hold this card aloft and call down a fiery meteor to a point you can see within 120 feet of yourself. Each creature within a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a [[/save ability=dex dc=17]] saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes [[/damage 6d6 type=bludgeoning]] damage and [[/damage 6d6 type=fire]] damage, or half as much damage on a successful save. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
